"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Wiederholung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">R4</div><h1>통합 복습 4</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wiederholung 4 · Lektion 30–37</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 30부터 37까지 배운 문법을 섞어서 풀어요.<br>여러 과의 문법이 한 문장에 함께 나와요. 기본 7 · 중간 5 · 도전 4 문제예요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 복습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">접속법 II와 접속법 I을 쓰임에 맞게 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">수동태와 분사로 문장을 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">추측의 화법조동사와 2격 전치사를 섞어서 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"51f67ea583\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Wenn ich mehr Zeit <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, würde ich öfter lesen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) hätte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사실과 반대되는 조건은 접속법 II hätte예요 (30과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c1b56ed356\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;renoviert&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Das Haus wird gerade <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(renovieren)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 집은 지금 수리 중이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Haus wird gerade <b>renoviert</b>.</div>수동태는 werden + 과거분사예요. -ieren 동사는 ge-가 없어요 (31과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"95482a304c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Sie sagt, sie <span class=\"qblank\"></span> morgen keinen Dienst.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) haben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) habe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) gehabt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) habt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">간접화법에서 sie(그녀)의 접속법 I은 habe예요 (33과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e19557339b\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;muss&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> krank sein, er hustet schon den ganzen Tag.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 아픈 게 틀림없어요. 하루 종일 기침을 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>muss</b> krank sein, er hustet schon den ganzen Tag.</div>확신하는 추측은 müssen이에요 (36과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5c27ce8d39\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그건 설득력 있는 아이디어예요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">überzeugte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Idee.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Das ist eine überzeugende Idee.</b></div>아이디어가 남을 설득하니까 현재분사 überzeugend예요 (32과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5c3180b4c7\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Geschäft wird um neun Uhr geöffnet.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> 수동태로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Man öffnet das Geschäft um neun Uhr.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 6\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Geschäft wird um neun Uhr geöffnet.</b></div>man은 빠지고 목적어 das Geschäft가 주어가 돼요 (31과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8dc1fa79e8\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ich bin schon sehr <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Ergebnis gespannt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) auf</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) an</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) über</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gespannt는 auf + 4격이에요 (34과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"813c3af10e\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;regnen&quot;],[&quot;würde&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Es sieht so aus, als ob es gleich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(regnen)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">곧 비가 올 것처럼 보여요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Es sieht so aus, als ob es gleich <b>regnen</b> <b>würde</b>.</div>als ob 뒤에는 접속법 II가 와요. würde + 원형에서 würde가 끝이에요 (30과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d9695fb877\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Schönheit der Stadt zieht viele Touristen an&quot;,&quot;Viele Touristen zieht die Schönheit der Stadt an&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 도시의 아름다움은 많은 관광객을 끌어들여요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">zieht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Schönheit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Touristen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">viele</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Stadt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Schönheit der Stadt zieht viele Touristen an.</b></div>schön → die Schönheit, 2격 der Stadt가 뒤에 붙어요. 분리 접두어 an은 끝이에요 (16·35과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5a5eccccf5\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"6\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀가 어제 병원에 있었다고 해요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">soll</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Krankenhaus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">gewesen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">haben.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Sie soll gestern im Krankenhaus gewesen sein.</b></div>gewesen은 sein과 함께 써요 (36과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"db80139e7f\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Lehrerin sagte, der Test finde morgen statt.&quot;,&quot;Die Lehrerin sagte, dass der Test morgen stattfinde.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 간접화법으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Die Lehrerin sagte: „Der Test findet morgen statt.“</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 11\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Lehrerin sagte, der Test finde morgen statt.</b></div>stattfinden의 접속법 I은 finde … statt예요 (33과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ace2b28923\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> des hohen Preises kauften viele Leute das neue Handy.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Statt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Obwohl</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Wegen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">값이 비싼데도 샀으니 trotz + 2격이에요. obwohl은 접속사예요 (37과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"28bfa455ef\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nach dem Abschluss des Studiums zog er nach Hamburg.&quot;,&quot;Nach Abschluss des Studiums zog er nach Hamburg.&quot;,&quot;Nach dem Abschluss seines Studiums zog er nach Hamburg.&quot;,&quot;Nach Abschluss seines Studiums zog er nach Hamburg.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 접속사 문장을 전치사구로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Nachdem er das Studium abgeschlossen hatte, zog er nach Hamburg.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 13\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nach dem Abschluss des Studiums zog er nach Hamburg.</b></div>nachdem → nach + 3격, abschließen → der Abschluss, 목적어는 2격으로 붙어요 (35·37과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c419c6dbdd\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">네가 전화했더라면 나는 바로 왔을 거야.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wenn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">mich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">angerufen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">hättest,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">hätte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">sofort</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">gekommen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wenn du mich angerufen hättest, wäre ich sofort gekommen.</b></div>kommen은 sein과 쓰는 동사라 과거의 접속법 II는 wäre + 과거분사예요 (30과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"caf1f9f299\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unterschriebenen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:18ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(unterschreiben · 과거분사)</span> Unterlagen liegen auf Ihrem Schreibtisch.</div><div class=\"qko\">서명된 서류는 당신 책상 위에 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die <b>unterschriebenen</b> Unterlagen liegen auf Ihrem Schreibtisch.</div>과거분사 unterschrieben에 정관사 뒤 복수 어미 -en이 붙어요 (32과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e9a957598e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Welcher Satz ist richtig?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Der Antrag muss bis Ende Mai eingereicht werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Der Antrag muss bis Ende Mai eingereicht worden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Der Antrag muss bis Ende Mai einreichen werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Der Antrag muss bis Ende Mai eingereicht sein werden.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">화법조동사가 있는 수동태는 과거분사 + werden이에요 (31과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"16\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 16</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"